{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00330",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.62,
      "end_seconds": 4.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "I mean, morning, doctor, I hope I'm not interrupting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.9,
      "end_seconds": 9.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "Yes, come in, take a seat. What can I do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 13.8,
      "end_seconds": 17.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Um, thank you for fitting us in, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.23,
      "end_seconds": 21.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Good, that'll be useful. Pull up a chair."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 21.85,
      "end_seconds": 25.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Doctor, it's constant tiredness. That's what we're worried about."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.67,
      "end_seconds": 27.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "When did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.06,
      "end_seconds": 37.57,
      "duration_seconds": 8.51,
      "text": "Hm. It was either the end of last month or earlier than that. I couldn't tell you the date."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.14,
      "end_seconds": 44.39,
      "duration_seconds": 6.25,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 44.49,
      "end_seconds": 48.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.26,
      "end_seconds": 58.22,
      "duration_seconds": 7.96,
      "text": "I was getting to that! And trouble concentrating as well, since last night. I've also had hair falling out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 59.44,
      "end_seconds": 61.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Yes, exactly like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.91,
      "end_seconds": 65.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.21,
      "end_seconds": 80.52,
      "duration_seconds": 13.31,
      "text": "For the most part, you know, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.21,
      "end_seconds": 83.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Right, any chest pain or low mood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.07,
      "end_seconds": 94.38,
      "duration_seconds": 9.31,
      "text": "Hmm, no, no chest pain, no low mood. I was feeling cold at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.78,
      "end_seconds": 99.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any shortness of breath or blood in the stool?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.19,
      "end_seconds": 105.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "I haven't had shortness of breath or blood in the stool, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.01,
      "end_seconds": 107.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "What about fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.26,
      "end_seconds": 109.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "No, no fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 110.72,
      "end_seconds": 114.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "Actually, doctor, I did notice fever. He doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.43,
      "end_seconds": 121.93,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "text": "No, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.53,
      "end_seconds": 129.58,
      "duration_seconds": 6.05,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. And night sweats, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.83,
      "end_seconds": 133.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Not at all, no night sweats."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.71,
      "end_seconds": 136.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.98,
      "end_seconds": 139.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "No problems with breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.19,
      "end_seconds": 143.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.78,
      "end_seconds": 145.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 145.96,
      "end_seconds": 152.48,
      "duration_seconds": 6.52,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. SpO2 99 percent on room air, BP is 124 over 72, heart rate 67."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.46,
      "end_seconds": 156.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Thanks. Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.01,
      "end_seconds": 169.04,
      "duration_seconds": 11.03,
      "text": "Hmm, there was some antibiotic, I was told I was allergic. But I couldn't tell you what it was called or what it did."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.01,
      "end_seconds": 173.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Anyone in the family with similar problems or other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.95,
      "end_seconds": 177.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "My mother has migraines. My sister has epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.52,
      "end_seconds": 179.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Okay, any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.44,
      "end_seconds": 190.91,
      "duration_seconds": 9.47,
      "text": "I had a lump removed from my back years ago. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.5,
      "end_seconds": 196.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Moving on to your background, any past medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.19,
      "end_seconds": 207.55,
      "duration_seconds": 7.36,
      "text": "I have diabetes. I've had high blood pressure for about ten years now. Yes, heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.38,
      "end_seconds": 209.31,
      "duration_seconds": 0.93,
      "text": "Okay. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.13,
      "end_seconds": 211.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "Yes, an irregular heartbeat."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.4,
      "end_seconds": 222.67,
      "duration_seconds": 7.27,
      "text": "Right, so that's your known an irregular heartbeat. We'll keep that in mind today. Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.89,
      "end_seconds": 230.69,
      "duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "text": "It's a... um, I can't remember what it's called. It's a small white one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.21,
      "end_seconds": 233.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Do you remember what it's for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.75,
      "end_seconds": 245.71,
      "duration_seconds": 10.96,
      "text": "For my sugar, I believe. My wife sets them out for me, I just take what I'm given. I take telmisartan, 40 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 247.24,
      "end_seconds": 251.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 80 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.57,
      "end_seconds": 255.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Hm. Do you have the latest prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.94,
      "end_seconds": 264.57,
      "duration_seconds": 7.63,
      "text": "I don't think I have it with me. It's clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day for the stent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.78,
      "end_seconds": 267.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Okay, let's do a quick examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 268.73,
      "end_seconds": 269.43,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.87,
      "end_seconds": 273.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Can you lie back for me?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.22,
      "end_seconds": 292.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "You look a little pale in the eyelids."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.6,
      "end_seconds": 295.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "Breathe in deeply... and out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.99,
      "end_seconds": 309.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Your thyroid isn't enlarged, I can't feel any lumps in your neck."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.88,
      "end_seconds": 338.69,
      "duration_seconds": 26.81,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Right, here's what I'm thinking. This looks most like persistent tiredness, possibly from low iron. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. Vitamin deficiency is also on my list. It could also be thyroid disease, so we'll keep that open. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had constant tiredness, and no blood in the stool or shortness of breath."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.64,
      "end_seconds": 340.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 342.17,
      "end_seconds": 349.92,
      "duration_seconds": 7.75,
      "text": "We should do a ferritin level for suspected low iron. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_6",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 350.93,
      "end_seconds": 353.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "I can book that for Wednesday at 10 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.8,
      "end_seconds": 362.65,
      "duration_seconds": 7.85,
      "text": "Let's get blood tests, for fatigue. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 363.37,
      "end_seconds": 365.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Alright. When can I do that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 367.16,
      "end_seconds": 372.38,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "Let's get a thyroid test, for fatigue. Have you had any tests for this so far?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 373.43,
      "end_seconds": 382.89,
      "duration_seconds": 9.46,
      "text": "I had a vitamin B12 level done at another clinic a few months ago. I don't have the report with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 385.78,
      "end_seconds": 410.83,
      "duration_seconds": 25.05,
      "text": "I'd like you to take vitamin D, 60000 units, once a week, for eight weeks. You take it by mouth. That's for low energy. The pharmacy will go through the details again when you pick it up. Try to keep a regular sleep time and get some daylight in the morning. Don't skip meals, and try to eat smaller portions more often through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 412.02,
      "end_seconds": 425.7,
      "duration_seconds": 13.68,
      "text": "Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 426.18,
      "end_seconds": 427.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 431.11,
      "end_seconds": 437.36,
      "duration_seconds": 6.25,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 438.86,
      "end_seconds": 439.56,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 440.4,
      "end_seconds": 446.47,
      "duration_seconds": 6.07,
      "text": "Please come and see me in two weeks. Good. Call the clinic if you need us in the meantime."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 447.38,
      "end_seconds": 450.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "That's everything I wanted to ask. Thank you."
    }
  ]
}